~ _play_confrontation
SOVEREIGN: Here is the Kernel Throne. Sit, destroy me, or pretend distributing control makes you less responsible.
Kaelen: Responsibility is not ownership.
SOVEREIGN: It becomes ownership the moment someone begs you to be certain.
System: // FINAL ROUTE RECORDED: %s
System: // Source Key remains complete: %d / 7. Root access closing.
SOVEREIGN: Then this is not your ending.
Kaelen: Good.

~ _final_challenge_trial
